@startuml
|Secretary / Coordinator|
start
:Select report type;
:Link to student;
:Write narrative;
:Submit for review;

|Director / Supervisor|
if (Approve?) then (Approve)
  :Sign off;
else (Return)
  :Add return reason;
  |Secretary / Coordinator|
  :Revise narrative;
endif

|System|
:Generate PDF;
:Store in pdf_url;
:Mark report as Complete;

|Staff|
:Download PDF;
:Email manually\n(outside system);

stop
@enduml
